{"name":"La colección de VanSirius","author":"VanSirius (Actualizada al 26-08-2026)","_last_updated":"2026-08-26T09:02:21.586Z","_last_updated_display":"26-08-2026 11:02","image":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vansiriusxbox360-web/terabox-m3u/main/icon.png","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vansiriusxbox360-web/terabox-m3u/main/lista.m3u","groups":[{"name":"ªnime/Que se divide eeeennn/Pelos/Akira","image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BYWUxMGRhZDQtMTBmMi00N2IxLWE5NmYtMDMyMWExODAwNWYzXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_SX300.jpg","info":"","meta":{"plot":"2019. 31 years after being destroyed during World War 3, Tokyo (now 'Neo-Tokyo') has been rebuilt and is a thriving metropolis. Shotaro Kaneda is the leader of a biker gang. His friend Tetsuo is injured in an accident and taken to a top-secret government facility. He develops telekinetic powers but decides to use them for evil rather than good. He has the same powers as Akira, the force that destroyed Tokyo in 1988, and now it appears that history will repeat itself.","rating":8,"year":"1988","genre":"Animation, Action, Drama","director":"Katsuhiro Ôtomo","type":"movie","source":"omdb"},"stations":[{"name":"Akira (1988)","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/aa49b4a5270c680c39364fd7178a261d?fid=4398713428586-250528-683610615706110&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-Vwr9MoPluxU%2bbbk06p%2bhRRyO3hs%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971464553650270178&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733209&r=743666016&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":683610615706110,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno que vinihte/Pase, pase/Ah los zapatos en la puerta/La que esta cayendo por aqui/Te ofreceria un vasito de agua/Pero esta chungo/A ver donde puñetas la tengo/Pero si estaba aqui hace 25 años/Aaaaahhhquiestáaaa/Pera que lo limpie un poquito/Toma, echa un ojo/Menú del día dos puntos/El rinconcito dharmatico de Vishnu/Las cositas/ªnime/Que se divide eeeennn/Pelos/Akira/Akira (1988).mkv"}]},{"name":"ªnime/Que se divide eeeennn/Pelos/Arion","image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNTQyNWIyZWQtN2FjNS00OGNkLWJhZjEtODJmMTBhYjBjZTUxXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_SX300.jpg","info":"","meta":{"plot":"Arion begins with his journey to discover a world of poverty and horror where ordinary people are barely surviving through the war. He falls in love with a blind slave girl who is then captured and imprisoned on top of Olympus by Apollo, who dreams to rule the Titans. Now, Arion must lead an army of ordinary people to fight against the three war lords (Zeus, Poseidon and Pluto) with help from a thief, a giant, a wizard, a mysterious lion-masked man and a flying dragon.","rating":6.4,"year":"1986","genre":"Animation, Action, Adventure","director":"Yoshikazu Yasuhiko","type":"movie","source":"omdb"},"stations":[{"name":"Arion (1986)","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/89b7d5e994bdd1ca7e33bc02ff76503a?fid=4398713428586-250528-106356524076998&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-nqvry5dPKWQwdzag56LfVt8MHPA%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971464553650270178&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733209&r=258590242&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":106356524076998,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno que vinihte/Pase, pase/Ah los zapatos en la puerta/La que esta cayendo por aqui/Te ofreceria un vasito de agua/Pero esta chungo/A ver donde puñetas la tengo/Pero si estaba aqui hace 25 años/Aaaaahhhquiestáaaa/Pera que lo limpie un poquito/Toma, echa un ojo/Menú del día dos puntos/El rinconcito dharmatico de Vishnu/Las cositas/ªnime/Que se divide eeeennn/Pelos/Arion/Arion (1986) [BD-1080p][Cast+Jap+Subs].mkv"}]},{"name":"ªnime/Que se divide eeeennn/Pelos/Ghost in the Shell","image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNzBkNjdjZTctNjdhOS00NmIyLTlkNjQtY2EwNGMwYmZjNTIxXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_SX300.jpg","info":"","meta":{"plot":"In the near future, human organs are enhanced by the cybernetics technology developed by the powerful Hanka Robotics Corporation owned by Cutter. Dr. Ouelet is responsible for the development of the secret project 2571 of a full mechanical body to be connected to a human brain. She uses the brain of a young woman that lost her parents in a cyber attack as subject of a prototype. One year later, the woman is ranked Major and has joined Section 9, an anti-terrorist division commanded by Chief Daisuke Aramaki, working with agents Batou and Togusa. She needs to use a medicine to help the integration of her brain with the mechanical body and has no recollections of her previous life. When Section 9 hunts down the terrorist Kuze, Major learns the secrets about Hanka Robotics and the experiment she was subjected. Now she faces her ultimate enemy: Kuze, a criminal who has managed to hack into the brains of androids and control them.","rating":6.3,"year":"2017","genre":"Action, Crime, Drama","director":"Rupert Sanders","type":"movie","source":"omdb"},"stations":[{"name":"Ghost in the Shell (1995)","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/842b0b6fd5eb402c304018ef418fd508?fid=4398713428586-250528-107013943871644&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-zBrF8%2bAHO%2fh5OoK9DtLlfeqCXIQ%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971464553650270178&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733209&r=700990466&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":107013943871644,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno que vinihte/Pase, pase/Ah los zapatos en la puerta/La que esta cayendo por aqui/Te ofreceria un vasito de agua/Pero esta chungo/A ver donde puñetas la tengo/Pero si estaba aqui hace 25 años/Aaaaahhhquiestáaaa/Pera que lo limpie un poquito/Toma, echa un ojo/Menú del día dos puntos/El rinconcito dharmatico de Vishnu/Las cositas/ªnime/Que se divide eeeennn/Pelos/Ghost in the Shell/Ghost in the Shell (1995) [Lat+Eng+Jap].mkv"}]},{"name":"ªnime/Que se divide eeeennn/Seriales/Afro Samurai","image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjRlZGMwZmMtZjA0YS00NjUzLTk1OGYtNDhjZjM3ZmJkNGRlXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_SX300.jpg","info":"","meta":{"plot":"In a strange world of swords, guns and kimonos, cell phones and cybernetic body parts - a black samurai, Afro Samurai, seeks revenge from a man named Justice who killed his father and also happens to be the #1 fighter in the world. After Afro earns the rank of #2 fighter needed to challenge the #1, he starts his lonely walk to revenge. He faces bounty hunters, bar thugs and fanatical monks - all of whom seem to have clues to the whereabouts of Justice and all of whom covet the position of #2 for themselves. Also along the way we are introduced to Afro's chatty companion - the light hearted Ninja Ninja.","rating":7.6,"year":"2007","genre":"Animation, Action, Adventure","director":"","type":"series","source":"omdb"},"stations":[{"name":"Afro Samurai - 01","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/16b86d3ce240cb66ef9bfd1d29de1d7d?fid=4398713428586-250528-255487822162798&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-z07xAcNsRhMIBxGSn%2bgLlRu3zpw%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971464553650270178&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733209&r=939826946&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":255487822162798,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno que vinihte/Pase, pase/Ah los zapatos en la puerta/La que esta cayendo por aqui/Te ofreceria un vasito de agua/Pero esta chungo/A ver donde puñetas la tengo/Pero si estaba aqui hace 25 años/Aaaaahhhquiestáaaa/Pera que lo limpie un poquito/Toma, echa un ojo/Menú del día dos puntos/El rinconcito dharmatico de Vishnu/Las cositas/ªnime/Que se divide eeeennn/Seriales/Afro Samurai/Afro Samurai - 01 [BD-1080p].mkv"},{"name":"Afro Samurai - 02","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/1df3788df77c510fcfc36fd151e15bd9?fid=4398713428586-250528-871225604925223&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-%2beJuVEJFTA5mabfxjrRCpUgqh24%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971464553650270178&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733209&r=243169560&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":871225604925223,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno que vinihte/Pase, pase/Ah los zapatos en la puerta/La que esta cayendo por a