jXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_SX300.jpg","info":"","meta":{"plot":"Lucius Modestus, an ancient Roman architect, finds himself job-hunting due to having trouble coming up with new ideas. As his demeanor and personality become dismal, his friends try taking him to a bathhouse for him to relax. Unable to unwind in the bustling and crowded bath, Lucius dips his head in the water. Down there, he finds a secret tunnel that transports him to a modern-day Japanese bathhouse, providing him the inspiration he needed to make a new creation. Loaded with what seems to be knowledge way ahead of his time, Lucius does his best to try and recreate his findings, usually inferior in quality due to his circumstances. However, the sheer ingenuity may be just enough to gain the attention of the citizens and regain his reputation as an architect.","rating":7,"year":"2022","genre":"Animation, Comedy, Fantasy","director":"","type":"series","source":"omdb"},"stations":[{"name":"Thermae Romae Novae Cap.01","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/e130c68717db4ac9ff01e45d00587a81?fid=4398713428586-250528-856990632941162&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-BrIcSFO%2fhUspJM9bPikkEqLnLbU%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971482094489593807&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733274&r=694380379&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":856990632941162,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno que vinihte/Pase, pase/Ah los zapatos en la puerta/La que esta cayendo por aqui/Te ofreceria un vasito de agua/Pero esta chungo/A ver donde puñetas la tengo/Pero si estaba aqui hace 25 años/Aaaaahhhquiestáaaa/Pera que lo limpie un poquito/Toma, echa un ojo/Menú del día dos puntos/El rinconcito dharmatico de Vishnu/Las cositas/Dibus que no son ªnime/las que te ponian comiendo/merendando o desayunando si tenías cerca el cole/Y que no haya dibus puede/o algo de ªnime puedes hallar/hoven padawan/(la carpeta spin-off que no te pillaba jamando)/pero puede que si te pille ya mayor/cositas que se ven por internet y streaming básicame