2 con mucha marcha y ᐉTPH,  en la 3 Megatrix o el Club Disney en Tele5/cuando Tele5 molaba y ponyta Pokémon el sábado/dibus puro infantil/Gargoyles/T1","image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMGU0ZjcxZjMtODU0NC00MWIyLTk5NWMtZDhhODlmMjI4M2Y1XkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_SX300.jpg","info":"","meta":{"plot":"In the Dark Ages, there was a race of heroic warrior monsters known as Gargoyles. These creatures existed as stone during the day, but become flesh and blood at night. One Scottish clan made an alliance with humans to help protect a castle by night if the humans would protect their stone forms by day. The uneasy alliance was shattered when human prejudice provoked a betrayal that allowed the castle to be sacked and most of the resident clan destroyed, leaving only six adult survivors and a rookery of unhatched eggs. A further misunderstanding during the clan's retaliation on the invaders and rescue of their hostages left the clan frozen in stone by a magic spell that would only be broken when the \"castle rises above the clouds.\" For a thousand years, the castle laid abandoned and the clan condemned by this curse. In 1994, a wealthy multibillionare named David Xanatos (Jonathan Frakes) bought the castle and transported the whole structure to Manhattan, where he placed it on top of the Eyrie building which he owned. It is high enough to be above the clouds, thus the conditions of the spell were met and the Gargoyles were revived. Now, this clan must adjust to this new age and gain friends, like Detective Elisa Maza (Salli Richardson-Whitfield), who reveals that Xanatos revived them to exploit them for his unscrupulous ends. This is coupled by the fact that another Gargoyle comrade, Demona (Marina Sirtis), is alive from their age, and is now an insane renegade bent on the extermination of humanity. Rebelling against them, the clan abandon the castle and pledge to protect New York City like they protected the castle in the past.","rating":8,"year":"1994–1997","genre":"Animation, Action, Adventure","director":"","type":"series","source":"omdb"},"stations":[{"name":"Gargoyles Héroes Mitológicos (Español de España) - 1x01 - El despertar (1ª parte)","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/bd355b3378b728965b80795403a65f2d?fid=4398713428586-250528-74964248034550&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-vRDcfnVpIMUownhLK%2fJEPRVKY%2fU%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971498393720214354&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733335&r=817545253&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":74964248034550,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno que vinihte/Pase, pase/Ah los zapatos en la puerta/La que esta cayendo por aqui/Te ofreceria un vasito de agua/Pero esta chungo/A ver donde puñetas la tengo/Pero si estaba aqui hace 25 años/Aaaaahhhquiestáaaa/Pera que lo limpie un poquito/Toma, echa un ojo/Menú del día dos puntos/El rinconcito dharmatico de Vishnu/Las cositas/Dibus que no son ªnime/las que te ponian comiendo/merendando o desayunando si tenías cerca el cole/Y que no haya dibus puede/o algo de ªnime puedes hallar/hoven padawan/en la 2 con mucha marcha y ᐉTPH,  en la 3 Megatrix o el Club Disney en Tele5/cuando Tele5 molaba y ponyta Pokémon el sábado/dibus puro infantil/Gargoyles/T1/Gargoyles Héroes Mitológicos (Español de España) - 1x01 - El despertar (1ª parte).mp4"},{"name":"Gargoyles Héroes Mitológicos (Español de España) - 1x02 - El despertar (2ª parte)","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/09ca2973631af899f0dd39a4888aaa5b?fid=4398713428586-250528-403752363356916&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-CAySbqtAU8BRfcCpGu%2flsxoFKz4%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971498577532436281&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733336&r=391734255&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":403752363356916,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno que vinihte/Pase, pase/Ah los zapatos en la puerta/La que esta cayendo por aqui/Te ofreceria un vasito de agua/Pero esta chungo/A ver donde puñetas la tengo/Pero si estaba aqui hace 25 años/Aaaaahhhquiestáaaa/Pera que l