. But one day while on an excursion to a laboratory a runaway radioactive spider bites him... and his life changes in a way no one could have imagined. Peter acquires a muscle-bound physique, clear vision, ability to cling to surfaces and crawl over walls, shooting webs from his wrist ... but the fun isn't going to last. An eccentric millionaire Norman Osborn administers a performance enhancing drug on himself and his maniacal alter ego Green Goblin emerges. Now Peter Parker has to become Spider-Man and take Green Goblin to the task... or else Goblin will kill him. They come face to face and the war begins in which only one of them will survive at the end.","rating":7.4,"year":"2002","genre":"Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi","director":"Sam Raimi","type":"movie","source":"omdb"},"stations":[{"name":"Spiderman 1x01 La Noche del Lagarto 1080p x265 AC3 Castellano Spanish","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/c2b34619112f3959e903157042844458?fid=4398713428586-250528-411873414193390&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-L7%2fLSOkSx2Qz2rlSWoOch2B0la4%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971517218592902883&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733405&r=759709669&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":411873414193390,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno que vinihte/Pase, pase/Ah los zapatos en la puerta/La que esta cayendo por aqui/Te ofreceria un vasito de agua/Pero esta chungo/A ver donde puñetas la tengo/Pero si estaba aqui hace 25 años/Aaaaahhhquiestáaaa/Pera que lo limpie un poquito/Toma, echa un ojo/Menú del día dos puntos/El rinconcito dharmatico de Vishnu/Las cositas/Dibus que no son ªnime/las que te ponian comiendo/merendando o desayunando si tenías cerca el cole/Y que no haya dibus puede/o algo de ªnime puedes hallar/hoven padawan/en la 2 con mucha marcha y ᐉTPH,  en la 3 Megatrix o el Club Disney en Tele5/cuando Tele5 molaba y ponyta Pokémon el sábado/dibus puro infantil/Spider-Man/Spiderman 1x01 La Noche del Lagarto 1080p x265 AC3 Castellano Spanish.mkv"},{"name":"Spi