ith Ryu as a child under the same master. Meanwhile, Major Guile of the United States Army is forced to team up with Chun Li from China in hopes of apprehending Bison and putting a stop his international ring of crime.","rating":7.2,"year":"1994","genre":"Animation, Action, Adventure","director":"Gisaburô Sugii","type":"movie","source":"omdb"},"stations":[{"name":"Street Figther II - 01","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/35d8d5e0cb196511645557c75698dc63?fid=4398713428586-250528-194481474840867&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-XlxjuqYzkrcl75e3wdiNovz1cM8%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971517609019436673&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733406&r=826405662&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":194481474840867,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno que vinihte/Pase, pase/Ah los zapatos en la puerta/La que esta cayendo por aqui/Te ofreceria un vasito de agua/Pero esta chungo/A ver donde puñetas la tengo/Pero si estaba aqui hace 25 años/Aaaaahhhquiestáaaa/Pera que lo limpie un poquito/Toma, echa un ojo/Menú del día dos puntos/El rinconcito dharmatico de Vishnu/Las cositas/Dibus que no son ªnime/las que te ponian comiendo/merendando o desayunando si tenías cerca el cole/Y que no haya dibus puede/o algo de ªnime puedes hallar/hoven padawan/en la 2 con mucha marcha y ᐉTPH,  en la 3 Megatrix o el Club Disney en Tele5/cuando Tele5 molaba y ponyta Pokémon el sábado/dibus puro infantil/Street Fighter II/Street Figther II - 01.avi","image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTVmY2I1YjctMDMwMS00OWFmLWFiNDktMTk2ZDljZDIzYTg4XkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_SX300.jpg"},{"name":"Street Figther II - 02","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/218a4fcb97ed49c471e05b8b6101e5bc?fid=4398713428586-250528-593184428838576&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-Go8RQzlFiCu4VZ9AEHWTnzahZM0%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971517609019436673&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733406&r=925629367&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":593184428838576,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno