ah (Odeya Rush). But every silver lining has a cloud, and Zach's comes when he learns that Hannah has a mysterious dad who is revealed to be R. L. Stine (Jack Black), the author of the bestselling Goosebumps series. It turns out that there is a reason why Stine is so strange - he is a prisoner of his own imagination - the monsters that his books made famous are real, and Stine protects his readers by keeping them locked up in their books. Zach unintentionally unleashes the monsters from their manuscripts and they begin to terrorize the town. It's up to Stine, Zach, Hannah, and Zach's friend Champ (Ryan Lee) to put all the monsters back in their books.","rating":6.3,"year":"2015","genre":"Adventure, Comedy, Family","director":"Rob Letterman","type":"movie","source":"omdb"},"stations":[{"name":"PESADILLAS Ep. 1 - LA MÁSCARA MALDITA (Parte 1 y 2)","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/6b00eb54d47ef5e7f9ff18363a0ecb41?fid=4398713428586-250528-532058311004628&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-otnNS5wttPYgYwkKvMkBQlwbaLs%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971521451271584802&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733421&r=349936309&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":532058311004628,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno que vinihte/Pase, pase/Ah los zapatos en la puerta/La que esta cayendo por aqui/Te ofreceria un vasito de agua/Pero esta chungo/A ver donde puñetas la tengo/Pero si estaba aqui hace 25 años/Aaaaahhhquiestáaaa/Pera que lo limpie un poquito/Toma, echa un ojo/Menú del día dos puntos/El rinconcito dharmatico de Vishnu/Las cositas/Dibus que no son ªnime/las que te ponian comiendo/merendando o desayunando si tenías cerca el cole/Y que no haya dibus puede/o algo de ªnime puedes hallar/hoven padawan/en la 2 con mucha marcha y ᐉTPH,  en la 3 Megatrix o el Club Disney en Tele5/cuando Tele5 molaba y ponyta Pokémon el sábado/no dibus, pero si infantil/Pesadillas (Goosebumps) de R L Stine/PESADILLAS Ep. 1 - LA MÁSCARA MALDITA (Parte 1 y 2).mkv"},{"name":"PESADILLA