re te decía en mis tiempos habia cosas muy bonitas/no como los Pokémon esos que el muñeco solo mueve la boca/Don Drácula","image":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vansiriusxbox360-web/terabox-m3u/main/custom-posters/don_dracula.jpg","info":"","meta":{"plot":"After living in Transylvania for several years, \"Earl Dracula\" has moved to Japan. In the Nerima Ward of Tokyo, he and his daughter, Chocola, and faithful servant Igor. While Chocola attends night classes at Matsutani Junior High School, Earl Dracula is desperate to drink the blood of beautiful virgin women; an appropriate meal for a vampire of his stature. However, each night that Earl Dracula goes out on the prowl he finds himself getting involved in some kind of disturbance which leads to him causing various trouble for the local residents. With nobody in Japan believing in vampires, his very presence causes trouble amongst the people in town.","rating":5.8,"year":"1982","genre":"Animation, Comedy, Horror","director":"","type":"series","source":"omdb"},"stations":[{"name":"1 El cazador de Drácula","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/53c65bcbfa149ff21af7720b45d02bb4?fid=4398713428586-250528-835451256700819&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-J0wcwXNn2HPS5lM7OW8uYDiz7mI%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971537356448692672&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733480&r=749799957&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":835451256700819,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno que vinihte/Pase, pase/Ah los zapatos en la puerta/La que esta cayendo por aqui/Te ofreceria un vasito de agua/Pero esta chungo/A ver donde puñetas la tengo/Pero si estaba aqui hace 25 años/Aaaaahhhquiestáaaa/Pera que lo limpie un poquito/Toma, echa un ojo/Menú del día dos puntos/El rinconcito dharmatico de Vishnu/Las cositas/Dibus que no son ªnime/las que te ponian comiendo/merendando o desayunando si tenías cerca el cole/Y que no haya dibus puede/o algo de ªnime puedes hallar/hoven padawan/las que te ponías en VHS o tu madre te decía e