tas/no como los Pokémon esos que el muñeco solo mueve la boca/El conde Pátula/El Conde Pátula 2x35.avi"}]},{"name":"Dibus que no son ªnime/las que te ponian comiendo/merendando o desayunando si tenías cerca el cole/Y que no haya dibus puede/o algo de ªnime puedes hallar/hoven padawan/las que te ponías en VHS o tu madre te decía en mis tiempos habia cosas muy bonitas/no como los Pokémon esos que el muñeco solo mueve la boca/El cuentacuentos","image":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vansiriusxbox360-web/terabox-m3u/main/custom-posters/el_cuentacuentos.jpg","info":"","meta":{"plot":"A variety of European folk tales are retold in nine new stories. A soldier captures Death in a magic sack. A fearless young man sets out to learn to shudder. A boy with a destiny that frightens a tyrant is sent on an impossible task that will see him wed the Princess, or dead. A storyteller must spin tales to stay alive. A woman bears a hedgehog-child who grows up to live alone in a castle until he does a King a favor and gets the Princess' hand in return. A Princess must keep silent while she works to free her brothers from an evil spell. A Princess runs away from wedding her father and disguises herself as an ugly forest creature. A young boy must overcome a heartless giant. A Princess searches the Earth for her stolen bridegroom.","rating":8.8,"year":"1987–1989","genre":"Adventure, Drama, Family","director":"","type":"series","source":"omdb"},"stations":[{"name":"El cuentacuentos - Mitos Griegos 01 Dedalo e Icaro 632x480","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/9da69b92cd2efa378f09fab21091a863?fid=4398713428586-250528-1056078922965183&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-ZWm3X97CvKNTm%2fGYCNfWpaqfCGY%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971538065274254307&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733483&r=281584665&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":1056078922965183,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno que vinihte/Pase, pase/Ah los zapatos en la puerta/La que esta cayendo por aqui/Te ofr