mon esos que el muñeco solo mueve la boca/Maguila Gorila/Maguila Gorila 1x31 El mensajero.mp4"}]},{"name":"Dibus que no son ªnime/las que te ponian comiendo/merendando o desayunando si tenías cerca el cole/Y que no haya dibus puede/o algo de ªnime puedes hallar/hoven padawan/las que te ponías en VHS o tu madre te decía en mis tiempos habia cosas muy bonitas/no como los Pokémon esos que el muñeco solo mueve la boca/Mofli","image":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vansiriusxbox360-web/terabox-m3u/main/custom-posters/mofli.jpg","info":"","meta":{"plot":"On 2020 Dr. Fool is an explorer who reveals to the world the existence of the last koala in the forest of Rivermint, a little town from Australia. As soon as the news of the discovery is spread Trombonetti, owner of a circus, decides to go to Rivermint to capture the koala for their circus with his faithful assistant Paolo. At the same time the rich, wayward and whimsical Rebeca convinces her grandfather to get the koala, want to capture Mofli and as a trophy with help of their trigger happy and personal hunter Iván. All these dangers will make that joyful and innocent Corina must be protect her lovely friend Mofli, the koala, with help of her best friend Bruno. But then Bruno is on a sly tempted by Rebeca to treason Corina, turning all more complicated.","rating":6.5,"year":"1986–","genre":"Adventure, Animation, Family","director":"","type":"series","source":"omdb"},"stations":[{"name":"MOFLI 1X01","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/7b6d7aecb54c97dd557e2b659bab1e9f?fid=4398713428586-250528-1050267289439038&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-OnNkn3bFjECSXQfh%2bd1dk3ZgWWQ%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=8971539963817276825&dp-callid=0&dstime=1787733490&r=100107906&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna","fs_id":1050267289439038,"path":"/Ooooohh buenos días/Que bueno que vinihte/Pase, pase/Ah los zapatos en la puerta/La que esta cayendo por aqui/Te ofreceria un vasito de agua/Pero esta chungo/A ver donde puñ